/* Starter UI Project: the project's own design tokens. The .xtui names this file as
   `shared.tokens`, so xtframe-pack and the editor load it before every UI's own stylesheets (a UI
   must not <link> it again). The preset symbol group (Broadsheet 2026, Docs/design/49-symbol-sets.md)
   is the implied default layer underneath: its tokens.xts supplies every standard token, its
   @font-face blocks and its textures, so only the values this project really overrides are declared
   here. A token that repeats the group's default is the lint warning `token.sameAsDefault`. themes/dark.xts redefines the colors. */
:root {
  /* Screen layout (conventions/layouts): the safe margin is 2.5 % of 1280 x 720 rounded up. */
  --safe-x: 32px;
  --safe-y: 24px;
}

@font-fallback zh-TW { font-family: "Noto Sans TC"; }
